(text "The Feather's two header rows, Adafruit's order from the USB end.\n3V3 and GND power the wing; D5, D9, D10 are new pins for the key port;\nSDA/SCL (GPIO3/4) or D11/D12 carry the key's bus, chosen by R9-R12." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 172.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2380e9f0-81ce-492f-9151-705b474591dc"))
