(text "key-c's USB-C socket carries I2C, not USB (hardware/key-pcb/PROPOSALS.md):\nSDA on D+ (A6), SCL on D- (A7), power on VBUS, a 5.1k Rd on each CC.\nOnly this plug's A row can be routed, and it is all a key needs: key-c\njoins its two rows. The B row is soldered for strength only." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 88.9 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f45dbb51-e829-437a-9959-78b047f5d7f0"))
