(text "The console end of key-c, as console-a has it:\n- VKEY comes through U2: 80 mA limit, reverse blocking, discharged\n  when off. Never straight from a GPIO. EN pulled up: on by default.\n- CC1 read on an ADC1 pin (D5). Plugged straight in, a key shows\n  5.1k on it whichever way up. U4's second pair is spare.\n- 2.2k pull-ups to VKEY, so a key that's off isn't powered through SDA/SCL.\n- U3/U4 rails on 3V3: the CC pull-ups can't feed VKEY." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 147.32 106.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "486fd935-34f9-4056-a30a-c7709c93eab0"))
